# ── Dev mode: strong AI for "build me a website/app" requests ──────────
# Add ONE key (uncomment the line and paste your key after the =).
#   OpenAI (ChatGPT):  https://platform.openai.com/api-keys   (needs billing set up)
#   Anthropic (Claude): https://console.anthropic.com/settings/keys (needs billing)
#   Google (Gemini):   https://aistudio.google.com/apikey     (has a FREE tier)
# OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...
# GEMINI_API_KEY=...
# Optional: force a provider when multiple keys exist -> DEV_PROVIDER=openai
# Optional: override models -> DEV_OPENAI_MODEL=gpt-5,gpt-4o
# Local model is BLOCKED for builds (too weak); set DEV_ALLOW_LOCAL=1 to override.
